OL,3,GNEWSAGrowth deal to create 4,000 jobs
OL,4,Ain north Wales by 2036, councillors
OL,5,Atold
OL,6,
OL,7,FCouncillors have been given assurances
OL,8,Fthat a multimillion-pound investment
OL,9,Fproject will deliver on its pledge to
OL,10,Fcreate 4,000 jobs in north Wales.
OL,12,FThe North Wales Growth Deal secured
OL,13,F#240m from the UK and Welsh governments
OL,14,Fto invest in transport, planning and
OL,15,Feconomic development projects in 2020.
OL,17,FThe plan is to secure a total of #1bn
OL,18,Fin public and private sector backing by
OL,19,F2036.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
