OL,3,GNEWSAGrowth deal to create 4,000 jobs
OL,4,Ain north Wales by 2036, councillors
OL,5,Atold
OL,6,
OL,7,FWrexham councillors questioned its
OL,8,Fprogress after a report said it had so
OL,9,Ffar created 121 jobs, with 63 full-time
OL,10,Fand 58 construction roles across seven
OL,11,Fprojects.
